Package: qore-sqlite3-module
Architecture: any
Depends: ${qore:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-sqlite3-module-doc
Description: SQLite3 database driver for Qore
 This module connects Qore's DBI API to SQLite databases, including prepared
 statements, transactions, binary data and in-memory databases. It uses the
 system SQLite library and does not need a separate database server.

Package: qore-sqlite3-module-doc
Section: doc
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Build-Profiles: <!nodoc>
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-sqlite3-module
Description: documentation and examples for Qore's SQLite3 driver
 This package contains the HTML API reference and example tests for Qore's
 SQLite3 database driver.
